--- TUTORIAL ---------------------------------------------

tutorial_intro_title == Tutorial
tutorial_intro_content == Welcome to Qwirkle!\This tutorial shows you the game screen\and explains how to play.\\You can open the menu at any time\by pressing [ ESC ].\\Press [ ENTER ] to continue

tutorial_playerPoints_title == Points
tutorial_playerPoints_content == Shows the points of the current player

tutorial_bagIndicator_title == Tile Bag
tutorial_bagIndicator_content == Shows how many tiles are\left in the bag.\After your turn your hand is\filled up from here

tutorial_nameIndicator_title == Turn Order
tutorial_nameIndicator_content == The big name is the player\whose turn it is.\The names behind are next

tutorial_cardHotbar_title == Your Tiles
tutorial_cardHotbar_content == These are the tiles in your hand.\Click a tile to select it,\click it again to unselect it

tutorial_playground_title == Board
tutorial_playground_content == This is the board where you place your tiles

tutorial_rules_title == How to play
tutorial_rules_content == Placing tiles\Place one or more tiles in a single row or column, without gaps.\Your tiles must touch a tile that is already on the board.\All tiles in a line share one color or one symbol,\and the same tile can't be in a line twice.\\Points\Every line you build or extend gives 1 point per tile in it.\A tile can count for its row and its column.\A line of 6 tiles is a Qwirkle and gives 6 extra points!\\Game end\The game ends when the bag is empty and a player has no tiles left.\The player with the most points wins.

